I am making video lessons based on the Wave Lessons. I also want to have a 
"Master Class" for each video detailing a bunch of nifty technical things 
you can do in each subject. If you would like to participate and teach a 
class or share a portion of a class, please let me know so I can arrange to 
get your video on the LLG's YouTube page. Also, if you have any interesting 
tidbits or videos you'd like to have some community coverage, please let me 
know and I'll put it up on the social media pages. My goal is to have a 
regular stream of media in the world of Lojban, so as much help as you can 
offer is really welcome.

